  "description": "Se-jin, who is obsessed with his normal daily life without parental interference, witnesses a scene in the professor's room sharing secret acts between his senior Woo-young and Professor Cho. And as if ridiculing Se-jin's efforts to forget about it, he accidentally gets involved with Woo-young. Every time he meets Woo-young like that, he begins to question the relationship between Woo-young and Professor Cho, and he gradually moves away from the life he had been protecting...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/daily_R/), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/daily_r), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000065517), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11669559), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260377)",
